    "text": "Sides are the straight edges. Corners are where two sides meet. A triangle has 3 of each.",
    "examples": [
      "a triangle has 3 sides",
      "a square has 4 corners"
    ],
    "reteach": "Put a finger on each corner as you count. Do not count the same one twice."
